index.html:161:        <p><strong>No dataset is used.</strong> No CF8 page embeds a dataset or reads a market data file. The cases in the labs and the project are generated from a seed or typed in for the module, and it is labelled SIMULATED. Real company filings in XBRL are not embedded, because no reuse terms for them are documented, so this unit does not use them. No CF8 result depends on it.</p>
L01.html:182:        <p class="hypothesis">Predicted before running. The three day counts and the cycle decompose exactly, so the identity of Proposition 2.2 holds for the three years of the filer and for each of 200 seeded filers. A rise in receivables with revenue held fixed moves the cycle by the same number of days as DSO (Proposition 2.4). Shortening 2025 DSO by five days with revenue fixed releases revenue times five over 365 in cents, to the cent. Average-balance DSO for 2025 is lower than year-end DSO, by the amount in Proposition 4.1. The filer is SIMULATED: its balances are typed in with generic field names, and Part E draws generated filers from a seeded generator. The lab reads no file and makes no network request. Real company filings are not embedded, so this page uses no real filing. Every number printed in Parts A to D comes from the filer typed below, and Part E uses only the generated filers it describes.</p>
